  "evidence": "TEXT_D: Freeze non‑essential immigration; detain and deport illegal entrants; leave the ECHR if needed; offshore processing; bar asylum from safe countries. Patriotic curriculum; ban transgender ideology in schools; single‑sex spaces; prioritise locals in social housing; protect country sports. 40,000 extra officers; zero‑tolerance policing; more stop and search; mandatory life for repeat violent offenders; British Bill of Rights; tighten postal voting. Scrap retained EU law; abandon Windsor Framework; prepare TCA renegotiation; distance from EU defence ties; “take back control.”\nTEXT_G: End Hostile Environment; scrap Illegal Migration Act and Rwanda plan; allow asylum seekers to work; expand safe/legal routes; reverse family threshold hike; protect EU citizens. Protect Human Rights Act; scrap anti‑protest laws; ban conversion therapy; proportional representation; votes at 16. Rebuild EU ties and aim to rejoin the Single Market; strong net‑zero and renewables push; ban fracking and new coal; end disproportionate Stop & Search.",
